" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="anchor-trigger" tabindex="0" id="anchor-trigger" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" role="link" class="r-muuvan"><div data-rid="de01b4c4-aee9-4804-b458-a244fc6d1294" class="r-18w76ey alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>About Get Face Fit</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="4d3cbb5f-8535-442b-a0a8-7a0b5d3d8aa4" data-anchor="two" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="anchor-trigger" tabindex="0" id="anchor-trigger" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" role="link" class="r-1fellt"><div data-rid="3026a93c-83d9-4df9-aa98-802fee747925" class="r-9ckqx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Products</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="fe4ad783-1bd0-40df-82f8-628fd4eaab72" data-anchor="three" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="anchor-trigger" tabindex="0" id="anchor-trigger" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" role="link" class="r-19jhnxj"><div data-rid="b9e2737d-90f7-4a41-a85c-bd3d2febeb9c" class="r-1cma470 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Orders & Payments</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="aec05261-9d27-458d-b6c0-1076ae5607e1" data-anchor="four" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="anchor-trigger" tabindex="0" id="anchor-trigger" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" role="link" class="r-1o8w2id"><div data-rid="09011e9c-36cf-454b-a682-a751e0307e93" class="r-14ptpvu alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">Shipping</span></div></div><div data-rid="66ac9ca8-0568-4107-a659-a421b1810fbf" data-anchor="five" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="anchor-trigger" tabindex="0" id="anchor-trigger" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" role="link" class="r-pp55e8"><div data-rid="36f24992-9c12-4a9b-ae66-640cc3122239" class="r-1xty7se alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">Returns</span></div></div><div data-rid="6745d381-5208-4663-98de-977053a6f845" data-anchor="six" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="anchor-trigger" tabindex="0" id="anchor-trigger" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" role="link" class="r-ona0v3"><div data-rid="0d206726-197e-4c16-ab26-a8810ed3fd79" class="r-mzm20c alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%">Results</span></div></div></div></div></div><section data-rid="b9d82ee0-40a9-41b6-99b3-f8b57342cde1" data-section="one" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="about" tabindex="-1" id="about" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-yisc31"><div data-rid="863ef262-07be-45ce-a668-4c986236e94a" class="r-59zate"><div data-rid="fad33d2d-bee5-4f3d-97fc-5ef81fccaaa3" class="r-1u6zep3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>About Get Face Fit</p></span></div><div data-rid="7c1432f4-b83e-4043-889c-3cdda5fb1a59" class="r-1i808i"><div data-rid="3dfe821c-61e6-4a85-a17b-58177ae012a5" class="r-ktqfgd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>About Get Face Fit</p></span></div><div data-rid="c7734710-58a1-45a0-952c-0343f6cedc19" class="r-1v34504 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Get Face Fit is a fascia-focused wellness brand merging functional skincare with intelligent tools. Rooted in fascia health  our approach goes beyond surface beauty. We teach people how to lift, sculpt and strengthen their skin naturally by improving circulation, elasticity, and muscle tone. No needles. No harsh treatments. Just evidence-based rituals designed to restore balance, release tension  and awaken the skin from within</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="e6578ad4-4803-483d-8af0-e1638a2f735f" class="r-1imz98y" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ce008ad1-3c71-4de5-b0f5-8c2a2865b944" class="r-1whw5l5" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ef5ecee1-ef78-44b2-a745-f1cdab10e223" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7sr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ihx1kv"><div data-rid="8e486a86-fbcd-4454-9f16-668d0e88fe0d" class="r-2ngcsd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What makes Get Face Fit different from traditional skincare brands?</p></span></div><div data-rid="e769917d-97c4-4c89-8e73-e885976e0bfe" class="r-1ly60td" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7sr2:"><div data-rid="1c81ecf5-3b01-4c8a-8ead-08fc486cee2c" class="r-2iq49s"><div data-rid="6d85ff86-752c-47ac-95a1-55471c08bf79" class="r-1fsxhd4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Most skincare focuses only on the surface. We go deeper by targeting fascia, the hidden layer beneath your skin that shapes how you age. Our products and methods work together to support long term skin resilience and natural lift</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a4288539-4a78-4c74-b92f-d0c6860d2c2d" class="r-14nf5bi" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="9f47dffb-6a94-4454-b082-603f94046718" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbsr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-2g83ll"><div data-rid="77c95e92-d374-464e-b4c1-9e219e7e3831" class="r-1n82dhq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are they safe for all skin types?</p></span></div><div data-rid="661fcd0f-be82-4adc-90a0-93257ab9c77e" class="r-1tahjio" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rbsr2:"><div data-rid="cf5ef893-d272-4329-9ecc-26772467547c" class="r-1n8ryfm"><div data-rid="6fe2aa3d-dbe8-4944-bbd7-a52604461b1e" class="r-1l53sii alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Yes. Both are gentle and safe for all skin types including sensitive or acne-prone skin</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="47ee82de-98d0-4bb5-99a3-2f4cfb52b61d" class="r-73c331" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e75de2fb-c6b6-44cc-987c-d4c8a3a28df5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rfsr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1908y3c"><div data-rid="6c0a0040-7660-44a3-82f4-cfdb6c192625" class="r-ajrckj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are your methods backed by science?</p></span></div><div data-rid="c26011b8-4d5b-4dc9-8604-fa722ddbcbce" class="r-gwt9u0" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rfsr2:"><div data-rid="bd18a5b0-42ef-4181-9a13-a8ad2c3e0f7c" class="r-z0j670"><div data-rid="5ec1f3b0-2f5a-4ba1-ba04-5220a32d7749" class="r-1fg0yda alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Absolutely. Our approach is grounded in fascia science, muscle structure, and clinical testing to ensure visible, lasting results.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="7320efa6-fc1d-44bb-ab4a-218f2b585c2c" class="r-6s61s5" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="b9d037ad-01cd-45c9-aa6a-da31715f56b8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rjsr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1co63jv"><div data-rid="f8144b4d-fc39-4951-aaf4-9265329eb548" class="r-p6zuf9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Who created Get Face Fit?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="def34a7c-0681-465c-b2e3-ff28642b8795" class="r-sf7ige" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rjsr2:"><div data-rid="710bea50-b9cd-499f-af4e-10d36b6b9603" class="r-1pirsva"><div data-rid="bfef605c-9d01-42c9-8c16-36f049f50ff7" class="r-1ib8r87 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Get Face Fit was founded by Olivia, a global facialist and fascia expert who has trained thousands of professionals and clients worldwide in holistic, non-invasive sculpting techniques.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-rid="3262eb92-d0b0-46c5-b784-0f2460c757a0" data-section="two" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="products" tabindex="-1" id="products" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-nqnca4"><div data-rid="896c9203-f277-46b0-8c04-b5c1cd2ad4ff" class="r-dqpmv4"><div data-rid="60a78cd9-1b92-486e-af62-6d577d9d6a64" class="r-12yevzx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Products</p></span></div><div data-rid="14165122-d838-4e39-811b-f7547d74e854" class="r-1rq5mow"><div data-rid="d543feea-fb0d-495e-ac83-91dfd18dac61" class="r-1k73f65 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Products</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="7c6d7219-1809-4b26-9f9a-e8a3b2658237" class="r-1qgonel" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c63c6fd5-656f-4be8-8752-0429781897be" class="r-tew20u" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="323e067c-d331-4e4e-9a29-3abb1c50e0b8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R6t32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1r53msc"><div data-rid="d1acbf66-723d-4bb6-bb91-5351700187b3" class="r-hhnmkn alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>What’s the difference between The Deep Balm and a regular moisturizer?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="f0d5f048-d14f-459e-bb53-4ea85e80f333" class="r-t2bghz" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R6t32:"><div data-rid="1ed77d3a-674a-4190-9188-88008dcbfb38" class="r-l67eg0"><div data-rid="025b722f-0238-4134-a704-5a0f6f94ac8c" class="r-jl2yvd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">The Deep Balm doesn’t just hydrate it strengthens your skin barrier, supports fascia health and boosts collagen for a lifted firm face over consistent use. This concentrated balm deeply nourishes the skin while supporting the skin barrier and naturally plumping your skin. Formulated with  plant based actives such as Bakuchiol and Ceramides it refines texture, smooths fine lines and strengthens the skin. With over 100 antioxidants from 20 botanical ingredients it calms, protects and energizes while the cushiony texture melts in for lasting hydration and a lifted radiant finish</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a82eb713-3dc7-4d8d-9ad0-fb91c6d97a65" class="r-1931wr7" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="88013afc-533f-4873-97d5-d177766b7a8f" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rat32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1rqg2xv"><div data-rid="07ffbe26-c43a-48ed-a0a4-7d80f2189a63" class="r-j0hxm9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What makes the Head In The Clouds Gua Sha different from a traditional face Gua Sha?</p></span></div><div data-rid="33312155-786e-45f8-87da-4d71b75ec665" class="r-1l0pfav" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rat32:"><div data-rid="7475a3fa-527b-4024-85c2-dbd21ba536d9" class="r-11vznun"><div data-rid="aafad915-37ab-4ac2-b5b3-65c4770a18bf" class="r-1jd7h5c alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">This isn’t a flat face tool. It’s designed to follow the contours of your face, neck  and scalp, working deeper to release fascia tension and boost circulation. With every stroke the Gua Sha works deep into the fascia releasing scalp tension and stimulating circulation. The result is a naturally lifted look that refines the neck, sculpts the lower face and restores face features</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9d7a534a-0a3c-40ad-aa06-2b91f3af70a9" class="r-5p0ehq" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e2eaf5ec-0a1c-459a-996c-60bca931687c" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Ret32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-12ps2rq"><div data-rid="af0ef61d-bf12-41ab-884a-e5f046f64728" class="r-1034ckt alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is it safe to use Deep Balm and Gua Sha for all skin and hair types?</p></span></div><div data-rid="ce5ff698-0339-4c41-afe1-55e7682d1a87" class="r-5fpwqr" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Ret32:"><div data-rid="fd82f0fb-8c55-4836-a962-e877874ed9e8" class="r-1ttz0b5"><div data-rid="b36c6008-8581-43bd-bb6f-fba8cd5afdf9" class="r-1jhewp7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Yes. Both are gentle and safe for all skin types including sensitive or acne-prone skin</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4754a853-c22d-45f4-a763-60a4a5942cc7" class="r-1ezj264" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="d99265b5-8f81-4f5b-b146-37a81eee788f" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rit32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1ss3ten"><div data-rid="0a2b6c64-a9c9-48ff-9022-cabfa4bf0198" class="r-1gk7yjj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is the Gua Sha made of?</p></span></div><div data-rid="5d1efbe6-c190-431b-aee7-012ad09e48ac" class="r-a34fd4" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rit32:"><div data-rid="f9b63e4a-3162-477b-a46e-8d3c2103ffe2" class="r-1xlo89n"><div data-rid="0b723f07-2d7f-4ff2-a871-25e172960065" class="r-1abxnu6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Each Gua Sha is handcrafted from natural ox horn, a fascia-friendly material composed of <em>keratin</em> the same structural protein found in human hair and nails. Known for its smooth, anti-static and naturally antibacterial properties the Head In The Clouds Gua Sha glides effortlessly across the skin supporting circulation and tension release while remaining gentle and hygienic. Every piece is carefully polished by hand  making each tool uniquely beautiful and designed to last</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f3f55b54-bf8d-4227-a675-47f959e43d5c" class="r-imkm8c" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="4130b1fe-75d2-4622-8c02-d32996662c51" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rmt32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1lgh79r"><div data-rid="6b250cad-580e-494b-bb49-a1cad3b30dd5" class="r-1t5k138 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Can I use The Deep Balm with other skincare products?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="7877f62a-7cf6-4e87-bd83-ee9ee8d4466b" class="r-zf2kij" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rmt32:"><div data-rid="6bd292c0-fe17-49e1-befe-7d7de16eff09" class="r-6qtai4"><div data-rid="92f4f1f2-bdcd-4156-a7db-3bc16bec9cc5" class="r-9m26s5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Yes. It’s designed to complement your routine</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="80a61f12-e478-4510-89bc-81facaad89fc" class="r-npo46k" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="370d771b-806f-4439-a4ca-d74fd5004aeb" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rqt32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-3ngqrj"><div data-rid="5882a47f-a05e-4156-b709-b3f11c66800e" class="r-100ylo6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Why do The Deep Balm and Gua Sha work so well together?</p></span></div><div data-rid="97f3a2a1-2ad0-4c3d-9a7b-871eef3eb44c" class="r-j4xwyy" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rqt32:"><div data-rid="2ae7e23a-3f82-431d-bccd-1f64f87c2b22" class="r-4tcj92"><div data-rid="9f59b039-f9a0-4c5f-8eb4-97df23a49be5" class="r-1pgzfff alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">The Deep Balm nourishes and gives perfect slip, while the Gua Sha tool stimulates fascia and circulation. Together they sculpt, tone and help define your features naturally</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="14fb3585-d616-4714-8fb8-1e2c3596fb32" class="r-ezygqu" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="b4ac62c2-d010-435a-be6d-95f413205bdb" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rut32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-y9pya6"><div data-rid="43cdc5aa-1d32-457f-b96c-6d99ec6f95a1" class="r-lxx4ze alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Is it normal to feel warmth or slight soreness after using Gua Sha?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="852272ed-0aba-44fe-aac5-8cbd8bc03c1f" class="r-vuuk69" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rut32:"><div data-rid="ec7753ee-68e3-4517-b8fc-0621a3ca283e" class="r-1baw4h5"><div data-rid="0c900c9f-bacf-4237-a12a-54729f54f8f9" class="r-md44l9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Yes, that’s a good sign! It means circulation is increasing and fascia is being activated. Any mild sensation fades quickly as your fascia adjusts</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b0849726-0213-4e37-9202-4921b83ea7b9" class="r-1vvkmg6" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="912a7fb3-3e48-4c44-9bca-f484f5543047" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R12t32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1d7dgn0"><div data-rid="ce7f02eb-06d9-476c-b9bd-d83ba630fb1f" class="r-1ggaq25 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Who is this combo for?</p></span></div><div data-rid="097c11ff-dca2-4402-8cd6-1a8242dafca1" class="r-a34bfd" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R12t32:"><div data-rid="1b29ed67-0990-4fa2-96fc-c7f8665e5ba1" class="r-1sspmji"><div data-rid="1dedd60b-2b18-490f-9b80-30a6bc3d709b" class="r-1l18vtp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">It’s for anyone who wants to lift, sculpt and restore their skin naturally without injectables or invasive treatments</span></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-rid="918aeaf8-8433-44e7-9cfa-cb9e7c394932" data-section="three" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="orders" tabindex="-1" id="orders" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-5jpjhq"><div data-rid="58e56541-7494-4a59-841c-705db19da0f4" class="r-ecpnz8"><div data-rid="eea06737-ed07-467d-ac76-e2ccfae528e0" class="r-dkw4hq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Orders & Payments</p></span></div><div data-rid="61bc73d2-8b48-4136-8fe9-35c91b3e300b" class="r-1uctfsx"><div data-rid="6253fb7e-3167-43fc-be20-b6c4dca7d118" class="r-1x6gp3u alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Orders & Payments</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="fb763b27-2290-4214-9400-dc474fb116b6" class="r-yovg1c" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="1350605d-9a6d-48e1-83c4-6357fd83d97a" class="r-8we0ew" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="488c4a4c-5f16-4565-82e3-b5e506975e39" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R6tb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ov7kd7"><div data-rid="617e4b4d-9341-45d9-ab4b-0e43c7425c69" class="r-1w4934e alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>What payment methods do you accept?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="535e4317-2d3f-456d-befe-9ad13bcc3401" class="r-1qu8obi" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R6tb2:"><div data-rid="8036c1dd-18a3-4533-b5fb-15b725ef33bc" class="r-oqsy13"><div data-rid="f684210a-bc98-4f39-ae39-c11b82c268b8" class="r-mee3he alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We accept all major debit and credit cards, PayPal, and secure subscription payments.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d11c9892-9cdb-455d-953c-6535f5f199e7" class="r-4tfxkl" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ff3249f1-c356-4bde-b2ce-f1c3c803e014" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Ratb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1766kd2"><div data-rid="cf3ae953-3e8c-4b1c-b92a-00bfb2155b4c" class="r-k45bvb alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Can I change or cancel my subscription?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="c32f4cae-13e7-4610-8d80-2a1f0f5c2a28" class="r-1q2uy7l" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Ratb2:"><div data-rid="93887305-940a-4b83-8a4f-582b797c943a" class="r-fs71pv"><div data-rid="64a257f1-f101-4196-93a1-173f711c8ace" class="r-r438d1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, you can manage or cancel your subscription anytime through your account — no hidden fees or long-term commitments.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-rid="6f36595c-9689-4e8b-ac93-790be2ba165a" data-section="four" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="shipping" tabindex="-1" id="shipping" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1o6iovt"><div data-rid="9b7b9aec-76eb-48c7-a7b1-749ff0a35e5d" class="r-zjd8jf"><div data-rid="ea04b9ca-7161-44ed-a492-a6f43a6051a1" class="r-6vi0er alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Shipping</p></span></div><div data-rid="4c97ea66-8089-4d80-b027-9044e18cc58a" class="r-r1er83"><div data-rid="22bc77d2-3442-4671-9e0f-8fbcaabec0f9" class="r-poe8op alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Shipping</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="446b9658-85a7-48e4-8d1e-f9d656b5b0ec" class="r-6xlng1" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3db0b286-7848-49d9-93d3-0d8d20e58907" class="r-fjmbuf" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="da85c429-4638-4953-89a0-71b3fbd5aead" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R6tj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-knsmyy"><div data-rid="8e7bf37c-7ffe-4b8f-bf32-6099670c49ce" class="r-17s5fk6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Where do you ship?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="cbafbecb-b1f1-41f7-8297-17a7e23f1cc2" class="r-1466dm5" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R6tj2:"><div data-rid="a6944511-8913-48bb-9882-d8fd150ac076" class="r-10jd950"><div data-rid="b45e5f3f-4664-4a4d-865e-085816f35379" class="r-f5q675 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We ship worldwide from our main fulfillment center in the EU.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f612b994-04bf-46e0-a7f9-9323fff421f5" class="r-1v0ubb2" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="519e0619-f924-4578-bde4-d1