ke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R6u32:"><div data-rid="84294687-a38f-42c2-b909-03ae23ec1810" class="r-qo87xs"><div data-rid="2de8282c-0e79-40ae-ac16-c4f6abc2e165" class="r-1sny8ua alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most users report visible changes - improved tone, radiance, and firmness, within 4 weeks of consistent use.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="372dcc37-b381-420d-aaf3-9d93fa9430ed" class="r-uc772c" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="60f46be7-82d0-4df3-bf57-26469b2ebc4a" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rau32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-116kpqm"><div data-rid="2bffd9c5-974d-4729-b2dd-7b5dd5f22461" class="r-5u9zgl alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Do I need to use the products daily?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="f183450a-e1f3-46da-b123-3fe4eea2b972" class="r-11qq5bd" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rau32:"><div data-rid="0c22a384-b96f-4872-9e1c-c68146cf3cba" class="r-8jk5k5"><div data-rid="2d8f7f5c-fc08-43e8-97cb-1fea45494293" class="r-1fypw2n alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, consistency is key. Just 5 minutes a day creates lasting results.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="931d9b0b-508e-4dae-8984-af7370fed1f4" class="r-596zoy" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="46bab227-3a65-4bb9-8d2c-4715fcc60208" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Reu32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-m7uksc"><div data-rid="2e79cca6-5d0b-4304-822e-fb0328e8597f" class="r-1kg74rg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Can I use the Deep Balm or Gua Sha after other treatments?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="1684517d-0043-4946-86a1-c481cce77d12" class="r-1e3vbam" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Reu32:"><div data-rid="217b3c25-7c97-4dd1-8138-06d2c23702d3" class="r-19a8pl5"><div data-rid="91a0259e-c547-417b-84b5-f7cbf77ffc1f" class="r-hrrm8c alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, they’re safe post-facial or between professional treatments. Always wait 24 hours after any intensive procedure.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="81ead49e-0cc6-4a7c-97c1-f9eeb2a5aa66" class="r-my2fu1" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="39cffacf-9f24-458c-b6ce-4ae21734a604" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Riu32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-6mbov6"><div data-rid="bcd77f4a-2705-4dd2-829a-ac87504566ce" class="r-lheg39 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Do I need to take a course to use the products correctly?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="9e3c92f5-692f-4a67-b23a-adbe3f5ce254" class="r-12dspf1" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Riu32:"><div data-rid="325435aa-e897-4bf3-8235-276cd8717dc7" class="r-jmawkt"><div data-rid="d544af08-4f18-4566-9fc2-e6cc52f6905d" class="r-1sz4ta3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Not at all. Each product includes guidance, and our free <span><strong>Natural Lift Guide</strong></span> teaches easy, effective hand techniques to get started.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div data-rid="ce910d92-aee4-408c-816f-da8ed2c9a7f2" class="r-3rd0in"><script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
    const anchors = document.querySelectorAll('#anchors #anchor-trigger');
    const sections = document.querySelectorAll('[data-section]');
    
    // Set first anchor as active on page load
    if (anchors.length > 0) {
        anchors[0].classList.add('active');
    }
    
    function checkActiveSection() {
        let currentActive = '';
        const scrollPosition = window.scrollY + (window.innerHeight / 3); // Use viewport height instead of fixed offset
        
        // Special case for top of the page
        if (window.scrollY < 0) { // Very close to top
            currentActive = sections[0]?.getAttribute('data-section') || '';
        } else {
            // Check each section to see if it's in viewport
            sections.forEach(section => {
                const sectionTop = section.offsetTop;
                const sectionHeight = section.offsetHeight;
                
                // Check if section is in viewport with a smaller threshold
                if (scrollPosition >= sectionTop && scrollPosition < sectionTop + sectionHeight) {
                    currentActive = section.getAttribute('data-section');
                }
            });
        }
        
        // Update active class on anchors
        anchors.forEach(anchor => {
            anchor.classList.remove('active');
            const anchorTarget = anchor.getAttribute('data-anchor');
            if (anchorTarget === currentActive) {
                anchor.classList.add('active');
            }
        });
    }
    
    // Add click event to anchors for smooth scrolling
    anchors.forEach(anchor => {
        anchor.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            const targetSectionName = this.getAttribute('data-anchor');
            const targetSection = document.querySelector(`[data-section="${targetSectionName}"]`);
            
            if (targetSection) {
                targetSection.scrollIntoView({
                    behavior: 'smooth',
                    block: 'start'
                });
            }
        });
    });
    
    // Listen for scroll events
    window.addEventListener('scroll', checkActiveSection);
    
    // Initial check on page load
    checkActiveSection();
});
</script>

<style>
#anchor-trigger.active {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
}
#anchor-trigger.active div {
    font-weight: 500 !important;
}
</style></div></div></div><style>@import url(https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950)</style><style id="replo-fonts-Get Face Fit Text">
